    "detailed_description": "If you're reading this, then you probably just died and got thrown out of Heaven. Sorry about that. Good news, though; you get to be on a gameshow!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/8b53cca61593fba68a3f43101e016eaf.poster.avif?t=1693800701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/8b53cca61593fba68a3f43101e016eaf.webm?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/8b53cca61593fba68a3f43101e016eaf.mp4?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Conquer Hell With Love and Snuggles!</strong><br>Fall For You is a rhythm-based roguelike. Dash and attack with the beat, win the hearts of every damned soul you meet, traverse perilous obstacle courses, win fabulous prizes that change the way you play, and cuddle with a scary demon mom to keep yourself going!<br><br><strong>Dance Party!</strong><br>Dash when the kick drum kicks, and attack when the snare drum snares!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/873dfc1a1cf138c9a6794a510daa16f9.poster.avif?t=1693800701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/873dfc1a1cf138c9a6794a510daa16f9.webm?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/873dfc1a1cf138c9a6794a510daa16f9.mp4?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Friends in Unexpected Places!</strong><br>Shoot fellow damned souls with Cuddle Bullets to earn their admiration! Do battle with the Underworld's scariest foes!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/9b0bbd5f2560701d712ef015bc9fd431.poster.avif?t=1693800701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/9b0bbd5f2560701d712ef015bc9fd431.webm?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/9b0bbd5f2560701d712ef015bc9fd431.mp4?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>The World Changes Around You!</strong><br>Stay above the UnderFog, as the world rises and falls around you! Take on procedurally generated challenges to stay in the game and win prizes!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/12f0326e91e5cb553b18e48b455a7d37.poster.avif?t=1693800701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/12f0326e91e5cb553b18e48b455a7d37.webm?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/12f0326e91e5cb553b18e48b455a7d37.mp4?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Fabulous Prizes!</strong><br>Win prizes that change your look, and the way you play!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/c362f4d6abcacb1efa21458cf15a25ce.poster.avif?t=1693800701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/c362f4d6abcacb1efa21458cf15a25ce.webm?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/c362f4d6abcacb1efa21458cf15a25ce.mp4?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A Place to Rest Your Head</strong><br>Cuddle with a scary demon mom to keep your health bar up! Survive the crazed whims of a self-proclaimed Goddesz of Chaos! Be nice to the twins!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/fc9470b1faa9e643db5261b637678e78.poster.avif?t=1693800701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/fc9470b1faa9e643db5261b637678e78.webm?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799730/extras/fc9470b1faa9e643db5261b637678e78.mp4?t=1693800701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
